&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;General Plastic Industrial Co., Ltd. (&lt;a
  href=&#34;https://www.gpi.com.tw/&#34;
    target=&#34;_blank&#34;
  &gt;GPI&lt;/a&gt;
) is a leading manufacturer and supplier of imaging supplies, specializing in copier and printer toner cartridges as well as OPC drum gears. Established in 1978, GPI is headquartered at 50, Tzu-Chiang Rd., Wu-Chi District, Taichung City, Taiwan 43546. As of December 31, 2017, the company reported a revenue of 60 million US dollars and employs over 500 people.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
